            </note>
            <note corresp="#d125-f3" n="2" xml:id="d125-f3-content">
                <p>Adlai E. Stevenson attended a reception given for Khrushchev in Des Moines in the
                    late afternoon of September 22, but no record of their conversation has been
                    found.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
